  m_Name: CharonDialog1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - npcText: "Welcome, wandering user\u2026 to the threshold of the Infernet. Here,
      where signal fades and ghosts of data linger, you tremble between realms. The
      air tastes of static, and the circuits hum with the voices of those uploaded
      before you.\nI am Char0n.exe, ferryman of the forgotten files, keeper of the
      Silent Port, guardian of the Unindexed Crossing.\nMany connect with hope, many
      with fear, yet all arrive owing a ping, a password, or a piece of themselves.\nIf
      you seek access, understand this: the Abyssal Network grants no mercy, logs
      no excuses\u2014only payment.\nStep forward. Authenticate.\nProve your worth
      to the daemon-web\u2026 and perhaps I shall ferry your signal across the dark
      fiber.\nHesitate\u2026 and the shadows in the code will claim you long before
      the current of the network ever does."
    answers:
    - text: Say Anything
      nextLineIndex: 1
      onSelected:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
    - text: Say Something
      nextLineIndex: 2
      onSelected:
